        "id": "U6-D2",
        "statement": "A withdrawal is identified as a posting of the account with Reference exactly \u0022withdraw\u0022 (ordinal string equality) and a negative Amount, dated with ledger.Today. The reference and the 500.00 limit are named public values Ledger.withdrawalReference and Ledger.dailyWithdrawalLimit so the rule lives in one place. Consequence: a debit or transfer a caller records with reference \u0022withdraw\u0022 is indistinguishable from a withdrawal and counts towards the limit; the requirement defines a withdrawal by its reference, and distinguishing them would need a new Posting field (a public type change) or new refusals on debit/transfer, both outside V8.",
